# app runtime. NOTE the leading slashes: an unanchored `library/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, and silently swallowed the whole
# engine/library package plus tests/library out of the repository. A clone then
# installed cleanly and failed at import with `No module named engine.library`.
/.server.pid
/.server.log
/library/

# generated sample data (scripts/make_sample_data.py regenerates it)
/data/
